Name: Oxc (The JavaScript Oxidation Compiler)
Short Name: oxc
URL: https://github.com/oxc-project/oxc
License: MIT
License File: LICENSE
Version: HEAD
Revision: HEAD
Security Critical: yes
Shipped: yes
Forks:
  - https://github.com/aphrody-labs/oxc
  - https://github.com/aphrody-labs/tsrs
  - https://github.com/aphrody-labs/tsgolint
  - https://github.com/aphrody-labs/oxc-zed
  - https://github.com/aphrody-labs/oxc-resolver
  - https://github.com/yolo-rs/tsrs
  - https://github.com/yolo-rs/tsgolint
  - https://github.com/yolo-rs/oxc-zed
  - https://github.com/yolo-rs/oxc-resolver

Description:
Collection of high-performance JavaScript/TypeScript tools written in Rust: parser, linter (oxlint),
formatter (oxfmt), transformer, minifier, resolver (oxc-resolver), TypeScript 7 port (tsrs),
type-aware linter (tsgolint), and Zed IDE extension (oxc-zed).
